  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1001.10 Legal address",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1001.10 “Legal address” means specification of the location where a person makes his/her residence. The term does not include addresses consisting solely of a post office box number.\n\nSource. #10176, eff 8-23-12; ss by #13685, eff 8-5-23",
